      <ArticleTitle>Dose-response relationship between weekly resistance training volume and increases in muscle mass: a systematic review and meta-analysis.</ArticleTitle>
      <Abstract>
        <AbstractText Label="OBJECTIVE" NlmCategory="OBJECTIVE">To quantify the dose-response relationship between weekly sets and hypertrophy.</AbstractText>
        <AbstractText Label="METHODS" NlmCategory="METHODS">We pooled 15 studies (n=390) comparing weekly set volumes.</AbstractText>
        <AbstractText Label="RESULTS" NlmCategory="RESULTS">Each additional weekly set was associated with a 0.37% increase in muscle size (95% CI 0.12 to 0.62).</AbstractText>
      </Abstract>
